    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just so tired of fighting. i've spent three years trying to fix my housing status, following every rule, filling out every single form, and every time it feels like the system just resets or hits a wall. it’s like i don't even exist to them. i'm just a glitch in their machine they can't be bothered to fix. there's literally no way out of this loop.",
